b. protection needs;
c. physical and mental health;
d. rehabilitation;
e. Social Reintegration;
f. legal assistance; and
g. Restitution.
(3) Further provisions regarding legal assistance as referred to in paragraph (2) letter f, are regulated in the Regent Regulation.

